<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="b4bf4e08">&lt;p&gt;
    Development of a realistic approach is an important cutover and deployment activity.  When building the
    approach:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Use the organization’s operating model as a framework; check cutover and deployment activities against each
        part of the framework
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Engage business and technology subject matter resources to help build and confirm the approach
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="7ab830d0"></attribute>
<attribute name="usageGuidance" nodeId="9493a4fc"></attribute>
<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="7e89838c">&lt;p&gt;
    The approach document presents the organization&apos;s strategy for the cutover and deployment.  It
    provides general direction set by leadership to guide the organization through a transition.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
